  (text "Section 9 of the circuit notes. The DSP's Level runs from -40 to +12 dB (chosen); here a volume pot RVX5\nand a fixed +12 dB stage, UX9 with RX22 and RX23 (chosen). RX24: the documented 1 kOhm output impedance [1]\n(as a series resistor, inferred). CX10: output coupling (chosen). The DSP's safety limiter has no counterpart." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5b283e30-30b4-5cce-a85e-83d5140746e6"))
